    "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request introduces a mechanism for dynamic mTLS certificate rotation by adding a refresh() capability to transport channels and implementing a RefreshingHttpJsonChannel for hot-swapping connections. It also updates various callables and retry algorithms to trigger these refreshes upon encountering unauthenticated errors. Feedback identifies a critical infinite loop bug in the new channel's entry retention logic and a violation of the ManagedChannel contract regarding termination status. Additionally, the reviewer recommends using System.nanoTime() for monotonic timing and advises against hardcoding environment variable checks in core library logic.",
